{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06396","headline":"送王道士还山 · 李颀","name":"送王道士还山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵩阳道士餐柏实，居处三花对石室。\n心穷伏火阳精丹，口诵淮王万毕术。\n自言神诀不可求，我师闻之玄圃游。\n出入彤庭佩金印，承恩赫赫如王侯。\n双峰树下曾受业，应传肘後长生法。\n吾闻仙地多後身，安知不是具茨人。\n玉膏清泠瀑泉水，白云谿中日方此。\n後今不见数十年，鬓发颜容只如是。\n先生舍我欲何归，竹杖黄裳登翠微。\n当有岩前白蝙蝠，迎君日暮双来飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}